{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260527/entry_horizontal_6a176da7ae58c953138664d6_1779920722918_640x360.jpg\"/><p>大麥娛樂截至3月底止年度，按年多賺近九成四，純利超過7億元人民幣。經調整EBITA超過7.4億元人民幣，跌近百分之8。</p><p>期內收入升近兩成，超過80億元人民幣。不派末期息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T23:18:48.833107+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}